        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Vibe coding pipelines depend almost entirely on proprietary models (Claude, Gemini) and centralized IDE infrastructure, meaning a single provider policy change or outage can block entire development workflows.",
          "source": "https://www.backslash.security/blog/the-vibe-coding-spectrum"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "Low",
          "note": "No jurisdiction has targeted AI-generated smart contracts specifically, but liability questions around who is responsible for exploits in autonomously written onchain code remain unresolved.",
